# Cursor indexing / context exclusions (Helm)

# Raw research dumps (use Docs/Research/RECONCILE.md instead)
Docs/Research/*.rtf
Docs/Research/extracted/

# Build artifacts
**/DerivedData/
**/.build/
build/
Helm.xcodeproj/

# Local / generated noise
Screenshots/
Secrets/
.swiftlint-cache
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate

# Large LLM/test fixtures (open explicitly when editing tests)
Packages/**/Tests/**/Fixtures/
Packages/**/Tests/**/fixtures/
